{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>About This Demo:</strong><br>This demo of Zoo Life Simulator lets you experience the beginning of your zoo journey. You will be able to:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build and name your own zoo</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Order, place, and take care of your first animals (such as Rabbits and Goats)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Feed animals, provide water, and keep them healthy</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Clean enclosures to improve visitor happiness</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the basics of visitor management and see guests arriving at your park</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock and set up a <strong>Service Area</strong> for your visitors</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience the day cycle: start, manage, and end a full day in your zoo</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Note:</strong><br>This demo focuses on the <strong>early-game experience</strong>. The full version will feature more animal species, larger enclosures, multiple biomes, advanced staff management, and a deeper progression system.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4081320/extras/e14b2ec1b546092ffcb708fa31346aa2.webp?t=1759563332\" width=550 height=63 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>In this demo, you\u2019ll discover the first steps of zoo management!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Zoo Life Simulator invites you to build, manage, and grow your own zoo in a detailed management and simulation experience. Whether playing solo or with up to 4 friends in co-op mode, you\u2019ll take care of animals, develop enclosures, satisfy visitors, and organize your staff.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4081320/extras/2520d00bc0c547f2a67d7bccb8346b6d.poster.avif?t=1759563332\" width=610 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4081320/extras/2520d00bc0c547f2a67d7bccb8346b6d.webm?t=1759563332\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4081320/extras/1802975f5d3f92c785b2d44d620125f8.webp?t=1759563332\" width=468 height=62 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019ll start your journey with a few basic animals. As you earn income, you\u2019ll unlock new species, build larger enclosures, and open different biomes. With the game\u2019s layered progression system, each new stage brings more animals, greater responsibilities, and richer content. Keeping your animals fed, clean, and happy ensures their health and makes them a delight for your visitors to see.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4081320/extras/1f2f068a0875a62585b7400b1e399c16.poster.avif?t=1759563332\" width=610 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4081320/extras/1f2f068a0875a62585b7400b1e399c16.webm?t=1759563332\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4081320/extras/1f2f068a0875a62585b7400b1e399c16.mp4?t=1759563332\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4081320/extras/94f68e26a7c1866ee53445f14de43c38.webp?t=1759563332\" width=320 height=62 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Share the tasks with your team:</strong> one player cares for the animals, another arranges visitor areas, while someone else manages the budget. Work together to grow your park and discover rare species!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4081320/extras/d9dd346612ba8dd34709d40b0e9c0060.poster.avif?t=1759563332\" width=610 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4081320/extras/d9dd346612ba8dd34709d40b0e9c0060.webm?t=1759563332\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4081320?t=1759563332","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4081320/142e45e8d4b9fc0b2857e6c18993f58c660d178f/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1759563332","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4081320/fc64308820befba5d506471ee2015f04ef2dd059/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759563332","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4081320/fc64308820befba5d506471ee2015f04ef2dd059/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759563332","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>About This Demo:</strong><br>This demo of Z